('Administration and Management', 'Aviation Management', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Aviation Management', 'Aviation Management brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Aviation Management studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_administration-and-management']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_administration-and-management","title":"Principles of Management","url":"https://openstax.org/books/principles-management/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 101","courseTitle":"Principles of Management","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 102","courseTitle":"Basic Mathematics","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 103","courseTi