('Administration and Management', 'Co-operative and Rural Development', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in Co-operative and Rural Development in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand Co-operative and Rural Development"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_administration-and-management']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_administration-and-management","title":"Principles of Management","url":"https://openstax.org/books/principles-management/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian People and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 101","courseTitle":"Principles of Management","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 102","courseTitle":"Basic Mathematics","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_man