('Administration and Management', 'Entrepreneurship', 'competency', 'apply-programme-learning', 'Apply what the programme teaches', 'This is the ability to use Entrepreneurship''s ideas and methods on a question, problem, project, case, design, experiment or practical task.', 'It connects the programme foundation to later domains and roles without claiming readiness for a job or licence.', 'A supervised piece of work that shows how the recorded knowledge or method was used.', 'useful_later', 'This comes after understanding the programme because application depends on the subject foundation.', '["Explain the programme''s main ideas"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_administration-and-management']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_administration-and-management","title":"Principles of Management","url":"https://openstax.org/books/principles-management/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 101","courseTitle":"Principles of Management","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 102","courseTitle":"Basic Mathematics","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 103","courseTitle":"Introduction to Computing","level":100},