('Administration and Management', 'Insurance', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Insurance', 'Insurance brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Insurance studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_administration-and-management']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_administration-and-management","title":"Principles of Management","url":"https://openstax.org/books/principles-management/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 101","courseTitle":"Principles of Management","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 102","courseTitle":"Basic Mathematics","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 103","courseTitle":"Introduction to Computer","level":