('Administration and Management', 'Office and Information Management', 'tool', 'excel', 'Excel', 'Excel is named in the programme record as one way to support spreadsheet work.', 'In Office and Information Management, it can support Excel where the relevant course or project requires it. It is an option, not the only tool.', 'A small, supervised spreadsheet output using Excel where the curriculum calls for it.', 'optional', 'Show this only because the parsed CCMAS record names the tool or software explicitly.', '["Explain the programme''s main ideas"]'::jsonb, '["Apply what the programme teaches"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_administration-and-management']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_administration-and-management","title":"Principles of Management","url":"https://openstax.org/books/principles-management/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian People and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 101","courseTitle":"Principles of Management","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 102","courseTitle":"Basic Mathematics","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"AMS 103","courseTitle":"Introduction to Computers","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","or