('Administration and Management', 'Petroleum Information Management', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Petroleum Information Management', 'Petroleum Information Management brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, design and technical practice, people, society and institutions and language, communication and interpretation.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Petroleum Information Management studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_administration-and-management']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_administration-and-management","title":"Principles of Management","url":"https://openstax.org/books/principles-management/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"PIM 101","courseTitle":"Introduction to Petroleum Studies","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administration_management.json","originalPdf":"Administration-and-Management.pdf","courseCode":"PIM 103","courseTitle":"Introduction to Information Technology in Oil and Gas","level":100},{"sourceFile":"administr