('Agricultural Science', 'Agribusiness', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Agribusiness', 'Agribusiness brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Agribusiness studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_agricultural-science']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_agricultural-science","title":"Agriculture open learning collection","url":"https://open.oregonstate.education/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"AGG 102","courseTitle":"Introduction to Agriculture I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"AGG 112","courseTitle":"Introduction to Agriculture II","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 101","courseTitle":"General Biology I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 107","courseTi