('Agricultural Science', 'B.Sc./B.Tech Food Science and Technology', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in B.Sc./B.Tech Food Science and Technology in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand B.Sc./B.Tech Food Science and Technology"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_agricultural-science']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_agricultural-science","title":"Agriculture open learning collection","url":"https://open.oregonstate.education/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"AGG 102","courseTitle":"Introduction to Agriculture I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"AGG 112","courseTitle":"Introduction to Agriculture II","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 101","courseTitle":"