('Agricultural Science', 'Water Resources Management and Agro-Meteorology', 'competency', 'apply-programme-learning', 'Apply what the programme teaches', 'This is the ability to use Water Resources Management and Agro-Meteorology''s ideas and methods on a question, problem, project, case, design, experiment or practical task.', 'It connects the programme foundation to later domains and roles without claiming readiness for a job or licence.', 'A supervised piece of work that shows how the recorded knowledge or method was used.', 'useful_later', 'This comes after understanding the programme because application depends on the subject foundation.', '["Explain the programme''s main ideas"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_agricultural-science']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_agricultural-science","title":"Agriculture open learning collection","url":"https://open.oregonstate.education/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"AGG 102","courseTitle":"Introduction to Agriculture I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"AGG 112","courseTitle":"Introduction to Agriculture II","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agriculture-2023.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 101","courseTitle":"General Biology I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"agricultural_science.json","originalPdf":"Agricultur