('Allied Health Sciences', 'Health Care Administration and Hospital Management', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Health Care Administration and Hospital Management', 'Health Care Administration and Hospital Management brings together research and evidence, design and technical practice, people, society and institutions, health, care and clinical foundations and language, communication and interpretation.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Health Care Administration and Hospital Management studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_allied-health-sciences']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_allied-health-sciences","title":"Anatomy and Physiology 2e","url":"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"HAM 211","courseTitle":"Ecology and General Introduction to Health Care/Hospital Administration","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"HAM 212","courseTitle":"Strategic Planning and Management in Public and Private Hospitals","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"HAM 221","courseTitle":"Human Resources Management in Healthcare Organisation","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"HAM 222","cou