('Allied Health Sciences', 'Health Care Administration and Hospital Management', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in Health Care Administration and Hospital Management in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand Health Care Administration and Hospital Management"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_allied-health-sciences']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_allied-health-sciences","title":"Anatomy and Physiology 2e","url":"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"HAM 211","courseTitle":"Ecology and General Introduction to Health Care/Hospital Administration","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"HAM 212","courseTitle":"Strategic Planning and Management in Public and Private Hospitals","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"HAM 221","courseTitle":"Human Resources Management in Healthcare Organisation","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":