('Allied Health Sciences', 'Human Nutrition and Dietetics', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Human Nutrition and Dietetics', 'Human Nutrition and Dietetics brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Human Nutrition and Dietetics studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_allied-health-sciences']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_allied-health-sciences","title":"Anatomy and Physiology 2e","url":"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"NUT 101","courseTitle":"Introduction to Human Nutrition and Dietetics","level":100},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"NUT 201","courseTitle":"Principles of Nutrition and Dietetics","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"NUT 202","courseTitle":"Introduction to Clinical Nutrition","level":200},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"NUT 301","courseTitle":"Food Composition, Analysis & Sensory Evaluation","level":300},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseC