('Allied Health Sciences', 'Speech-Language Therapy', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in Speech-Language Therapy in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand Speech-Language Therapy"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_allied-health-sciences']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_allied-health-sciences","title":"Anatomy and Physiology 2e","url":"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"SLT 311","courseTitle":"Introduction to Speech-Language Therapy","level":300},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"SLT 312","courseTitle":"Speech-Language Development Across the Span","level":300},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"SLT 313","courseTitle":"Clinical Methods in Speech-Language Therapy","level":300},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-Sciences-2023.pdf","courseCode":"SLT 411","courseTitle":"Speech-Language Disorders Across the Span","level":400},{"sourceFile":"allied_health.json","originalPdf":"Allied-Health-