('Communication and Media Studies', 'DEVELOPMENT COMMUNICATION STUDIES — P12, P13, P14', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand DEVELOPMENT COMMUNICATION STUDIES — P12, P13, P14', 'DEVELOPMENT COMMUNICATION STUDIES — P12, P13, P14 brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, design and technical practice, people, society and institutions and health, care and clinical foundations.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what DEVELOPMENT COMMUNICATION STUDIES — P12, P13, P14 studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_communication-and-media-studies']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_communication-and-media-studies","title":"Communication open textbooks","url":"https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/subjects/communication","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"communication_media.json","originalPdf":"Communication-and-Media-Studies-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"communication_media.json","originalPdf":"Communication-and-Media-Studies-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"communication_media.json","originalPdf":"Communication-and-Media-Studies-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"CMS 101","courseTitle":"Introduction to Human Communication","level":100},{"sourceFile":"communication_media.json","originalPdf":"Communication-and-Media-Studies-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"C