('Education', 'Environmental Education', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in Environmental Education in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand Environmental Education"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_education']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_education","title":"Education open textbooks","url":"https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/subjects/education","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication In English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"EED 111","courseTitle":"Education","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"ENT 211","courseTitle":"Entrepreneurship and Innovation","level":200},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"EED 211","courseTitle":"Environmental Education Method I","level":200},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-202