('Education', 'Geography', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in Geography in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand Geography"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_education']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_education","title":"Education open textbooks","url":"https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/subjects/education","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GEO 101","courseTitle":"Introduction Physical Geography","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GEO 102","courseTitle":"Introduction to Human Geography","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GEO 103","courseTitle":"Introduction to Practical Geography","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GEO 104","courseTitle":"Local Field Studies","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"G