('Education', 'Integrated Science', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Integrated Science', 'Integrated Science brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Integrated Science studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_education']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_education","title":"Education open textbooks","url":"https://open.umn.edu/opentextbooks/subjects/education","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigeria Peoples and culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 101","courseTitle":"General Biology I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 102","courseTitle":"General Biology II","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 107","courseTitle":"General Biology Practical I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"education.json","originalPdf":"Education-CCMAS-2023-New.pdf","courseCode":"BIO 108","courseTitle":"General Biology Practical II",