('Engineering', 'CIVIL ENGINEERING', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand CIVIL ENGINEERING', 'CIVIL ENGINEERING brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what CIVIL ENGINEERING studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_engineering']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_engineering","title":"Engineering open learning collection","url":"https://eng.libretexts.org/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"CHM 101","courseTitle":"General Chemistry I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"CHM 102","courseTitle":"General Chemistry II","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"CHM 107","courseTitle":"General Practical Chemistry I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Tech