('Engineering', 'COMPUTER ENGINEERING', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand COMPUTER ENGINEERING', 'COMPUTER ENGINEERING brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what COMPUTER ENGINEERING studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_engineering']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_engineering","title":"Engineering open learning collection","url":"https://eng.libretexts.org/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"MTH 101","courseTitle":"Elementary Mathematics I: Algebra and Trigonometry","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"MTH 102","courseTitle":"Elementary Mathematics II: Calculus","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"PHY 101","courseTitle":"General Physics I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"eng