('Engineering', 'COMPUTER ENGINEERING', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in COMPUTER ENGINEERING in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand COMPUTER ENGINEERING"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_engineering']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_engineering","title":"Engineering open learning collection","url":"https://eng.libretexts.org/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"MTH 101","courseTitle":"Elementary Mathematics I: Algebra and Trigonometry","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"MTH 102","courseTitle":"Elementary Mathematics II: Calculus","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"PHY 101","courseTitle":