('Engineering', 'FOOD ENGINEERING', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in FOOD ENGINEERING in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand FOOD ENGINEERING"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_engineering']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_engineering","title":"Engineering open learning collection","url":"https://eng.libretexts.org/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian People and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GET 101","courseTitle":"Engineer in Society Engineering Graphics and Solid Modeling 15 45","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GET 102","courseTitle":"I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"engineering.json","originalPdf":"Engineering-Technology-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"CHM 101","courseTitle":"General Chemistry I","level":