('Environmental Sciences', 'Surveying and Geoinformatics', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Surveying and Geoinformatics', 'Surveying and Geoinformatics brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Surveying and Geoinformatics studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_environmental-sciences']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_environmental-sciences","title":"Environmental and natural-resource open learning","url":"https://open.oregonstate.education/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"PHY 101","courseTitle":"General Physics I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"PHY 102","courseTitle":"General Physics II","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf