('Environmental Sciences', 'Surveying and Geoinformatics', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in Surveying and Geoinformatics in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand Surveying and Geoinformatics"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_environmental-sciences']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_environmental-sciences","title":"Environmental and natural-resource open learning","url":"https://open.oregonstate.education/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"PHY 101","courseTitle":"General Physics I","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Environmental-Sciences-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"PHY 102","courseTitle":"General Physics II","level":100},{"sourceFile":"environmental_sciences.json","originalPdf":"