('Medicine and Dentistry', 'Bachelor of Dental Surgery (BDS/BChD)', 'skill', 'understand-programme-foundation', 'Understand Bachelor of Dental Surgery (BDS/BChD)', 'Bachelor of Dental Surgery (BDS/BChD) brings together research and evidence, mathematics and quantitative reasoning, laboratory and scientific practice, design and technical practice and people, society and institutions.', 'Use the curriculum as a map of the ideas, methods and applications you are likely to meet in this programme.', 'A simple explanation of what Bachelor of Dental Surgery (BDS/BChD) studies and how its main subjects fit together.', 'start_here', 'Start here because the CCMAS record is the programme''s national curriculum foundation.', '[]'::jsonb, '["explain-programme-ideas"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_medicine-and-dentistry']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_medicine-and-dentistry","title":"Anatomy and Physiology 2e","url":"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/1-introduction","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"medicine_dentistry.json","originalPdf":"Medicine-and-Dentistry-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication in English","level":null},{"sourceFile":"medicine_dentistry.json","originalPdf":"Medicine-and-Dentistry-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":null},{"sourceFile":"medicine_dentistry.json","originalPdf":"Medicine-and-Dentistry-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"MTH 101","courseTitle":"Elementary Mathematics I","level":null},{"sourceFile":"medicine_dentistry.json","originalPdf":"Medicine-and-Dentistry-CCMAS-2023-FINAL.pdf","courseCode":"MTH 102","courseTitle":"Elementary Mathematics II","level":null},{"sourceFile":"medicine_dentistry.json","original