('Social Sciences', 'Peace Studies and Conflict Resolution', 'competency', 'explain-programme-ideas', 'Explain the programme''s main ideas', 'This means being able to describe the key ideas in Peace Studies and Conflict Resolution in your own words and connect them to the course topics.', 'Build this after orientation so the student can tell the difference between memorising course titles and understanding what the programme does.', 'A short explanation, comparison, diagram, calculation, design, experiment, case analysis or other output appropriate to the programme.', 'build_next', 'Build this next because the CCMAS outcomes move from subject knowledge into understanding and application.', '["Understand Peace Studies and Conflict Resolution"]'::jsonb, '["apply-programme-learning"]'::jsonb, ARRAY['nuc_ccmas','open_reference_social-sciences']::text[], '[{"id":"nuc_ccmas","title":"NUC CCMAS source page","url":"https://www.nuc.edu.ng/ccmas/","region":"nigeria","evidenceType":"official_curriculum_source"},{"id":"open_reference_social-sciences","title":"Social Science Research: Principles, Methods and Practices","url":"https://usq.pressbooks.pub/socialscienceresearch/","region":"global","evidenceType":"free_foundation_reference"}]'::jsonb, '[{"sourceFile":"social_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","courseCode":"GST 111","courseTitle":"Communication Skills in English","level":100},{"sourceFile":"social_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","courseCode":"GST 112","courseTitle":"Nigerian Peoples and Culture","level":100},{"sourceFile":"social_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","courseCode":"PCR 101","courseTitle":"Introduction to Peace Studies","level":100},{"sourceFile":"social_sciences.json","originalPdf":"Social-Sciences-CCMAS-FINAL-2023-A.pdf","courseCode":"PCR 102","courseTitle":"Socio-Cultural Factors in Conflict Resolution","level":100},{"sourceFile":"social_sciences.